/E (Results-driven chief product officer with over 6 years of experience in product management, specializing in fintech and mental health tech. Proven track record of driving innovation and growth in fast-paced startup environments. Led the development and launch of successful products at Noma Financial, increasing revenue by 200% and improving loan acceptance rates by 40%. Founded and scaled Havoc Therapy, achieving 100% year-over-year growth in user base and revenue. Expertise in developing long-term product strategies, managing cross-functional teams of 50+, and aligning product roadmaps with business objectives. Skilled in leveraging emerging technologies, including AI, to enhance product offerings and operational efficiency. Recognized industry leader, featured in Silicon India's "10 Best Mental Health Startups" and nominated "Business Leader of the Year" by The Economic Times.)
